  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "AI Assistant for Umbraco 17:\n- Add a Rich Text Editor toolbar assistant to generate drafts, improve selected text, and preview results before inserting or replacing content.\n- Include optional field context, with an accessible info tooltip explaining how it is used.\n- Introduce a responsive prompt dialog with separate instruction and preview panels, themed icons, and clearer action buttons.\n- Refresh the backoffice setup layout with theme-aware colours and feature setup guidance.\n- Control public page summaries independently with the Enable page summaries switch; rich text generation remains available when summaries are disabled.\n- Verify the shared provider connection before saving settings and protect stored credentials with ASP.NET Core Data Protection.\n- Support Azure OpenAI, OpenAI, Claude, Gemini, DeepSeek, and Ollama; cache identical page summaries for one day while editor generation and connection tests bypass the cache.\n- Replace the deprecated Microsoft.Extensions.AI.Ollama dependency with OllamaSharp.\n- Update installation, configuration, privacy, and development documentation.",
